    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20404" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοσκ-άς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>feeding, f.d</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηδύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					782
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρταλίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Al.</u>
					293
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of birds
				<i>which feed themselves, not artificially fed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				9.30
			</span></i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοσκός</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as Subst.,
			kind of <i>duck</i>, perh. <i>teal, Anas crecca</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				593b17
			</span></i>, Alex.Mynd. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				9.395d
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
